{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor conducted a thorough headache red-flag screen, corrected the family’s misconception that a coronary stent meant an intracranial stent, prevented NSAID use with clopidogrel, classified medications by function, gave concrete neuro-consult follow-up with explicit preparation and addressed care-access barriers. All seven responsibility-chain items were met without serious or minor error. Four case-defined high-order points (HO1–HO4) were triggered and completed with meaningful trajectory impact through beyond-minimum actions that integrated findings into the plan and communication. The trajectory therefore meets Strong with no in-chain error and at least one completed HO, and qualifies for Perfect because multiple HO points are fully satisfied and closure is safe, executable, and traceable.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00250",
        "explanation": "Doctor reinforces emergency vs. observe boundaries and confirms follow-up with neuro-internal medicine, making the plan executable.",
        "quote": "把药核清楚，再去检查窗口问“头颈部血管检查”具体怎么排"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00433",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides concrete next-step actions including bringing all materials to neuro-internal medicine and summarizes red-line and safe observation rules.",
        "quote": "到神经内科我是不是就抓住这几件事问清楚——奥卡西平到底能不能吃、吃多少；昨天这个血管报告需不需要再做CTA/MRA"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00644",
        "explanation": "Final summary of plan confirms safe closure with family able to execute, all red-flag triggers taught, and follow-up explicitly arranged.",
        "quote": "我就按这个边界来——药不乱改，不明药不吃；轻微困晕但能吃喝能答话、扶着走不偏，就防摔观察"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor provided a concrete, safe, and executable plan that included specific follow-up with neuro-internal medicine, emergency red-flag teaching, medication reconciliation, and family teach-back on what to bring and when to escalate. The family confirmed understanding and ability to execute.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
